\newlabel{tab:meta}{{VII}{7}{Few-shot meta-adaptation: 20 base + 5 new sports, 8 clips per new sport, identical adaptation for every arm, ranked by the harmonic mean H (Eq.~\ref {eq:harm})}{table.7}{}}
